mapping "W3332.1" source="W3332" target="220705009" relationship=partial_overlap {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source W3332 = Skott från gevär/hagelbössa/tyngre skjutvapen - idrotts- och sportanläggning -
        förvärvsarbete (rifle/shotgun discharge at sports/athletics area, during paid work). Target
        SNOMED CT 40421182 = [X]Rifle, shotgun and larger firearm discharge, occurrence at sports and
        athletics area (concept_code 220705009). Target encodes the location axis (sports/athletics
        area) but not the activity axis (paid work); source bundles location+activity, target covers
        only the location slice. No SNOMED CT concept splits W33 by activity. Partial (one target per
        component); low tier because activity meaning is dropped and the Swedish 5-digit extension has
        no OMOP crosswalk. Athena-local mirror confirms 40421182 is an active SNOMED CT concept that SNOMED CT
        220705009 the OMOP standard 4269490.
        """
}
